{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>By this shall you be tested.</b> Meaning, he would be satisfied with this test, even though it is not sufficient for what he had proven from their own words when they said they came to bring Joseph out, as I have written." "<b>Or</b> it may intend that it would come out right along the lines of what they wanted — that they came to bring Joseph out of the hand of the purchaser — if their youngest brother comes and his heart will understand that which he intends."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 42, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:47:58.549737457Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}